  "religion": {
    "_note": "The Cwealmingas are Chaotic alone: they venerate the CHAOTIC powers directly, by their Anglo-Saxon reflexes (with Norse-overlay variants among the sea-raiders) - phoneme-morphs of the Agrippan canon, never real Germanic/Norse gods. The Lawful powers are the hated 'thrall-gods' of weak folk, named only to curse; the One is reviled as the distant tyrant.",
