      "9": "Heah-bloter (high sacrificer)"
    },
    "demon_epithet_pattern": "the LAWFUL powers are the enemy-gods, named to curse, each with a scornful epithet: Tulrius -> Thulor the Thrall-Light; Orlandus -> Eorland the Oath-Chain; Aeternus -> Aetern the Far Tyrant. (Norse-overlay raiders curse them in the Norse reflexes: Thulr, Orlund.)",
